<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Deja mark: one frame, and a second one showing from behind it to the right - the thing you
  already saw, seen again. Geometry traced from the source logo, so the proportions here are
  measured rather than approximated: both frames carry a thicker bottom bar than top, which is
  what stops them reading as plain rectangles.

  Drawn in three passes. The cream frame goes down first, then a solid background-coloured shape
  in the amber frame's outline hides the part of it that sits behind, then the amber frame goes
  on top. That middle pass is what makes the overlap read as depth; without it the cream frame
  shows through the amber window.
-->
